activity Threat Identify
activity Threat Analyze
activity Threat Prioritize
activity Threat Mitigate
activity Threat Report
activity Threat Review
bind Threat Identify: Status Threat
bind Threat Analyze: Level Threat, Score Impact
bind Threat Prioritize: Level Threat
bind Threat Mitigate: Strategy Mitigation
bind Threat Report: Status Threat
bind Threat Review: Time Response
Level Threat: integer between 1 and 10
Score Impact: float between 0.0 and 100.0
Status Threat: Identified, Analyzed, Mitigated, Reported
Strategy Mitigation: Isolation, Patch, Monitor
Time Response: integer between 1 and 72
Init[Threat Identify] | |
End[Threat Review] | |
Chain Response[Threat Identify, Threat Analyze] | | |0,2,h
Response[Threat Analyze, Threat Prioritize] | | |
Precedence[Threat Mitigate, Threat Prioritize] |A.Level Threat > 5 | |
Response[Threat Mitigate, Threat Report] | | |
Chain Succession[Threat Report, Threat Review] |A.Status Threat is Reported | |
Existence[Threat Analyze] | |
Chain Response[Threat Mitigate, Threat Review] | | |0,48,h
Not Chain Succession[Threat Mitigate, Threat Mitigate] | |A.Strategy Mitigation != T.Strategy Mitigation |